### Register
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create note
POST http://localhost:4000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First note",
  "body": "hello",
  "tags": ["work"],
  "pinned": false
}

### List notes
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notes?q=hello&tag=work&pinned=false&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get note (replace id)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Patch note
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Updated", "pinned": true }

### Delete note
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Missing token
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notes

### Garbled token
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer not.a.real.token

### Validation error
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "bad", "password": "short" }

### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health
